{"id":325285,"bangumiId":325285,"type":2,"name":"オッドタクシー","name_cn":"奇巧计程车","date":"2021-04-05","year":"2021","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/65/90/325285_4688X.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/65/90/325285_4688X.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/65/90/325285_4688X.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/65/90/325285_4688X.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/65/90/325285_4688X.jpg"},"summary":"明明是熟悉的街道，这座城市却似乎有哪里变得不太一样了。\r\n出租车司机小户川每天平凡度日。他没有亲人，鲜少与人交流，是个有点孤僻木讷的怪人。兴趣是在睡前听落语和工作时听广播。姑且能称得上是他朋友的人，只有他的主治医生刚力，以及高中同学柿花而已。\r\n他载到的尽是些有点古怪的客人：一心想在网路上被疯传的大学生，桦泽；似乎有所隐情的护理师，白川；不太红的搞笑二人组，智人拍档；街头无赖，阴沟；正要开始走红的偶像女团，神秘之吻等。\r\n人与人之间百无聊赖的对话，最后竟与一位失踪少女扯上了关系。","rating":{"rank":41,"total":22320,"count":{"1":32,"2":17,"3":18,"4":29,"5":98,"6":416,"7":1872,"8":7371,"9":9522,"10":2945},"score":8.5},"collection":{"on_hold":881,"dropped":244,"wish":7420,"collect":33652,"doing":1883},"tags":[{"name":"原创","count":6315,"total_count":637030},{"name":"悬疑","count":6169,"total_count":117017},{"name":"群像","count":4324,"total_count":13198},{"name":"2021年4月","count":2704,"total_count":25971},{"name":"TV","count":2360,"total_count":1446175},{"name":"推理","count":2321,"total_count":75602},{"name":"剧情","count":2284,"total_count":16502},{"name":"P.I.C.S.","count":1780,"total_count":1889},{"name":"动物","count":1700,"total_count":6307},{"name":"2021","count":1339,"total_count":80486},{"name":"OLM","count":788,"total_count":13122},{"name":"木下麦","count":547,"total_count":684},{"name":"神作","count":406,"total_count":48390},{"name":"日本","count":374,"total_count":315220},{"name":"此元和津也","count":333,"total_count":417},{"name":"日本动画","count":154,"total_count":36114},{"name":"木村良平","count":56,"total_count":3007},{"name":"2021年","count":49,"total_count":3685},{"name":"都市","count":38,"total_count":793},{"name":"奇巧计程车","count":38,"total_count":46},{"name":"奇幻","count":33,"total_count":493204},{"name":"日常","cou